# Global plugins for Codex and OpenCode.
#
# Format: one entry per line, <agent> <plugin-id> <source>.
#   agent      codex or opencode
#   plugin-id  id reported by the agent's plugin list (also the Codex
#              plugin@marketplace selector)
#   source     argument of the install command: the Codex marketplace
#              source, or the OpenCode package specifier
# Lines starting with # are comments. Claude Code plugins live in
# stow/common/claude/.claude/settings.json instead.

codex pstack@pstack-claude michael-denyer/pstack-claude
opencode pstack github:michael-denyer/pstack-claude#main
